      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F0075002000740068006500720065002100100002011401470000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Have you ever had someone use the move Protect\nagainst you in a Pokémon battle?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŇ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It’s so neat how when a Pokémon uses Protect, it\nnegates all incoming damage!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŇ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But I actually prefer the move Detect!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSure, maybe Protect keeps your Pokémon safe for\nlonger, but you can use Detect more frequently!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŇ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 142
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Let’s have a battle, Trainer. Let me show you how\nstrong Detect is!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŇ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C0065007420190073002000680061007600650020006100200062006100740074006C0065002C00200054007200610069006E00650072002E0020004C006500740020006D0065002000730068006F007700200079006F007500200068006F0077000A007300740072006F006E00670020004400650074006500630074002000690073002100100002011401470000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Just give a shout when you’re ready to have a\nbattle with me!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŇ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A0075007300740020006700690076006500200061002000730068006F007500740020007700680065006E00200079006F007520190072006500200072006500610064007900200074006F0020006800610076006500200061000A0062006100740074006C0065002000770069007400680020006D0065002100100002011401470000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
